<title>USA: Elf licenses DuPont refrigerant.</title>
<headline>Elf licenses DuPont refrigerant.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>DuPont Co said it licensed a key refrigerant to Elf Atochem for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>Currently manufactured and marketed by DuPont as Suva HP62, with an ASHRAE designation of R-404A, the non ozone-depleting refrigerant is a replacemet for R502 in commercial refrigeration systems. It is offered by the Elf Aquitaine unit under the name Forane 404A.</p>
<p>DuPont noted it has also licensed AlliedSignal Inc to make and market R-404A.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
